content:
Help me define bounded contexts. Below I will provide domain information. 

#### Data:
These are the extracted objects and the subdomain grouping:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Library Member",
      "description": "A person registered to use library services.",
      "attributes": [
        "Member Record",
        "Library Card"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Member Record",
      "description": "The stored personal and borrowing information of a Library Member."
    },
    {
      "name": "Library Card",
      "description": "The identification card issued to a Library Member."
    },
    {
      "name": "Loan",
      "description": "A record of a Library Member borrowing a Book.",
      "attributes": [
        "Book"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Book",
      "description": "A library item that can be borrowed.",
      "attributes": [
        "Status"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Status",
      "description": "The current condition or availability state of a Book."
    },
    {
      "name": "Membership Request",
      "description": "A request from a Library Member to obtain membership."
    },
    {
      "name": "Lost Book Report",
      "description": "A report filed by a Library Member about a missing Book."
    },
    {
      "name": "Member Services Clerk",
      "description": "A staff member responsible for assisting Library Members with administrative tasks."
    },
    {
      "name": "Librarian",
      "description": "A staff member responsible for cataloging and managing library materials."
    },
    {
      "name": "Library System",
      "description": "The catalog and inventory system used by the Librarian.",
      "attributes": [
        "Book"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Collection Archivist",
      "description": "A staff member responsible for preserving and evaluating library materials."
    },
    {
      "name": "Inspection",
      "description": "An assessment of a Book performed by the Collection Archivist."
    },
    {
      "name": "Preservation Task",
      "description": "A restoration or protection activity scheduled for a Book."
    },
    {
      "name": "Book Donor",
      "description": "A person or organization donating books to the library."
    },
    {
      "name": "Donation",
      "description": "A contribution from a Book Donor.",
      "attributes": [
        "Book"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Book Supply",
      "description": "A batch of provided books.",
      "attributes": [
        "Book"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Acquisitions Manager",
      "description": "A staff member responsible for ordering new books and managing the acquisitions budget."
    },
    {
      "name": "External Supplier",
      "description": "A provider that delivers Books to the library."
    },
    {
      "name": "Purchase Suggestion",
      "description": "A proposed Book for acquisition.",
      "attributes": [
        "Book"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Order",
      "description": "A request issued to acquire new Books.",
      "attributes": [
        "Book"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Acquisitions Budget",
      "description": "The funds available for purchasing new Books."
    }
  ]
}
```
