#### Task:
- Assign the subdomains to bounded contexts. 
- Name the subdomain the bounded context might be derived from, it might also be multiple.
- Identify cases, where an object does not have a unified meaning across all bounded contexts and suggest a name change.
- Return the bounded contexts in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "...": {
      "derived from": "...",
      "objects": [
        "...",
        "...",
        "..."
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "... -> ..."
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

Here are the bounded contexts: 
```json
{
  "bounded contexts": {
    "Loaning": {
      "derived from": "Loaning Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Library Member",
        "Member Record",
        "Library Card",
        "Member Services Clerk",
        "Membership Request",
        "Lost Book Report",
        "Loan",
        "Loaned Book"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Book -> Loaned Book"
      ]
    },
    "Donation": {
      "derived from": "Donation Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Book Donor",
        "Donation",
        "Book",
        "Collection Archivist",
        "Donation Supply"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Collection Archivist -> Donation Reviewer",
        "Book Supply -> Donation Supply"
      ]
    },
    "Acquisition": {
      "derived from": "Acquisition Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Acquisitions Manager",
        "Order",
        "Ordered Book",
        "Suggested Title",
        "External Supplier",
        "Purchase Suggestion",
        "Acquisitions Budget"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Book -> Ordered Book",
        "Book -> Suggested Title"
      ]
    },
    "Archiving": {
      "derived from": "Archiving Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Collection Archivist",
        "Inspection",
        "Preservation Task"
      ],
      "name changes": []
    },
    "Record Keeping": {
      "derived from": "Record Keeping Subdomain",
      "objects": [
        "Librarian",
        "Library System",
        "Book Record",
        "Status"
      ],
      "name changes": [
        "Book -> Book Record"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
